<title>USA: Chase named advisor Sakhalin II oil project.</title>
<headline>Chase named advisor Sakhalin II oil project.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Bank said on Friday that it will be financial advisor to Sakhalin Energy Investment Co Ltd for the first phase of the group's oil and gas project in Russia.</p>
<p>Sakhalin Energy is a consortium of Marathon Sakhalin Ltd, McDermott Sakhalin Inc, Mitsui Sakhalin Development Co Ltd, Shell Sakhalin Holdings BV and Diamond Gas Sakhalin BV, a subsidiary of Mitsubishi Corp.</p>
<p>The consortium is developing the Sakhalin II offshore oil and gas license in Far East Russia, Chase said.</p>
</text>
